          "date": "2026-06-29 12:00:57.000000000",
          "tz": 480
        },
        "subject": "LU-20211 mdt: trunc(0) with layout swap on degraded stripes",
        "message": "LU-20211 mdt: trunc(0) with layout swap on degraded stripes\n\nWhen truncate(0) hits a supported file with stripes on inactive\nor degraded OSTs, move the old layout onto a volatile victim and\nrecreate a fresh layout on the file from currently active OSTs.\n\nAdd MD_LAYOUT_UNAVAILABLE and MD_LAYOUT_CREATE layout ops, teach\nlod_generate_lovea() to emit uninstantiated LOVEA templates, and hook\nlayout replacement from MDT setattr.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Keguang Xu <kxu@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I07e0792a51e144d935cece4b028e17f659e4ccfd\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
